<p>Equally critical is the Lorry Receipt (LR) or Bilty, which serves as the contract of carriage between the customer and the transport provider. For enhanced reliability, many clients prefer <bokaro packers and movers> who issue IBA-approved Lorry Receipts.</p>
<p>These standardized documents provide clear terms regarding liability, transit times, and damage claims, offering a layer of legal protection that informal carriers often lack. The <packers and movers bokaro steel city> sector has increasingly adopted these professional standards to build trust with clients seeking transparent and accountable services.</p>

